          "description": "Like a tweet (FavoriteTweet). Pass the numeric tweet id. Already liked (FavoriteTweet code 139) returns { success: false, alreadyLiked: true, tweetId } instead of throwing. Prefer likedByMe on read tools over probing with x_like.",
