        {
          "tool_name": "x-article__x_follow",
          "description": "Follow a user (REST 1.1 friendships/create). Provide EXACTLY one of `userId` (numeric rest_id) or `screenName` (@handle; looked up via UserByScreenName). HTTP 200 means the follow was accepted: { success: true, following: true }. create is async, so a stale following=false on the user object is not a failure. reason is only set on a real reject (pending / blocked / protected / restricted / rate_limited / unknown). HTTP 429 is { success: false, rateLimited: true, retryAfterSec?, code: 88 }. Prefer following on read tools over probing with x_follow.",
