          "tool_name": "x-article__x_article_revise",
          "description": "Edit an article that may already be published. Direct UpdateTitle on a published article returns GraphQL 214 — there is no published-edit mutation in this client-web bundle. This tool tries the draft updates first; on 214 it Unpublishes, applies title/markdown, then Publishes again (set republish:false to leave it as a draft). Same ops as the granular tools; does not invent a queryId. Provide title and/or markdown.",
